        "content": "<p>avanhatt opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15102\">PR #15102</a> from <code>avanhatt:isle-ctrl-lookup</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/are-we-fast-yet/issues/14\">are-we-fast-yet</a> identified a +0.68% instructions retired compilation regression on Sightglass from  #15052. </p>\n<p>This PR attempts to gain some cycles back by (1) inlining, and (2) using an existing <code>requires_typevar_operand</code> helper to avoid a more expensive lookup in the common case. </p>\n<p>Roughly cuts in half the compile-time cost from #15052 (geomean instructions retired from +0.65% to +0.39% relative to before #15052 on macOS aarch64).</p>\n<p>CC @fitzgen </p>\n</blockquote>",
